          "value": "<p><strong>Robot traits.</strong> Robots are constructs (Bestiary 5). They are vulnerable to critical hits (critical hits deal an extra ×1 multiplier, for example ×3 instead of ×2) and to electricity (+50% damage). Many carry a force field and integrated weapons.</p>"
